{"1733020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Climber Girl", "steam_appid": 1733020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the adventure game Climper Girl on PC, guide the heroine, a champion climber, to find a mysterious artifact. Explore nine levels to get your hands on the coveted relic before your enemies, a sinister secret society, find it first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the young adventurer and uncover the mysteries of an ancient civilization whose legacy threatens the entire human race.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in a unique game that offers not only a captivating adventure, but also a realistic climbing simulation.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover innovative gameplay thanks to a special engine that allows you to control each of the adventurer's limbs independently.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a rich game experience that includes exploration, shooting, infiltration, platforming, and various puzzles to solve.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of environments (tombs, caves, labyrinths) created by an ancient civilization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face different enemies in hand-to-hand combat or with your weapons (Beretta, Ingram, USP, AK 47).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress at your own pace: dare to engage in direct combat or use your climbing skills to move stealthily.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the adventure game Climper Girl on PC, guide the heroine, a champion climber, to find a mysterious artifact. Explore nine levels to get your hands on the coveted relic before your enemies, a sinister secret society, find it first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the young adventurer and uncover the mysteries of an ancient civilization whose legacy threatens the entire human race.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in a unique game that offers not only a captivating adventure, but also a realistic climbing simulation.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover innovative gameplay thanks to a special engine that allows you to control each of the adventurer's limbs independently.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a rich game experience that includes exploration, shooting, infiltration, platforming, and various puzzles to solve.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of environments (tombs, caves, labyrinths) created by an ancient civilization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face different enemies in hand-to-hand combat or with your weapons (Beretta, Ingram, USP, AK 47).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress at your own pace: dare to engage in direct combat or use your climbing skills to move stealthily.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Play as the young adventurer and uncover the mysteries of an ancient civilization whose legacy threatens the entire human race.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733020/83cb2c8a0780860496ec168133448c0c476d1bc1/header.jpg?t=1759159764", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733020/c3a680174f91df53c2e49975ea26f7cb57ed7672/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759159764", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733020/c3a680174f91df53c2e49975ea26f7cb57ed7672/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759159764", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP/Vista/7/8/10/11<br></li><